    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald is absolutely delighted to introduce No.71 Saran Wood to the market. This superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom, end of terrace duplex extends to a spacious 108 sq.m. and is presented in absolute 'turn-key' condition. Constructed in 2004, the current owners have made substantial upgrades further enhancing the appeal of this lovely property. Upgrades include the installation of a new Ideal gas boiler in 2025, and in 2023, the total refurbishment of the three bathrooms, reflooring to include wide blank engineered timber floorboards, luxurious deep pile carpets and new tiling, the installation of handy Smart Storage understairs units, attic insulation and flooring, smart technology enabled lighting, heating and alarm controls and the inclusion of quality finishes and the use of tasteful décor throughout. \n \nThe property is exceptionally well situated within Saran Wood, being positioned at the end of a quiet terrace with lovely views of the surrounding countryside. It is very private and benefits from two generous balconies commanding views of both the Sugarloaf to the front and the manicured communal grounds to the rear. Adjacent to the property is a coded gate for residents providing pedestrian access to an expansive amenity green and beyond to Shoreline Leisure Centre with gym and swimming pool.\n\nThe interior layout is scheduled over two floors and, in brief, comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with beautiful flooring, an upgraded guest WC, and decorative ceiling coving. An emphasis has been placed on maximising storage with Smart Storage installed beneath the stairs along with a separate storage press to the right of the front door. To the right off the hall is the most attractive kitchen / breakfast room with access to the south facing front balcony with its verdant outlook. This room contains tiled flooring, an attractive range of modern, high gloss cabinetry, tiled splashbacks and appliances to include a Smeg undercounter oven, Indesit ceramic hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge and freezer, Montpellier dishwasher, Zanussi washing machine and Amica dryer. To the rear there is a spacious and naturally bright living / dining room spanning the width of the property, featuring a fireplace with gas inset, continuation of the timber flooring, and ceiling coving. Double doors lead out to the second balcony which enjoys a pleasant outlook over the communal garden. \n\nOn the first floor there are three bedrooms, two doubles and one single, all three include luxurious carpeted flooring while both double bedrooms incorporate fitted wardrobes. The principal bedroom mirrors the living room in terms of size and gains from a modern and enlarged ensuite shower room to incorporate a large shower (85cm x 120cm). Off the sizable landing there is a contemporary family bathroom which, like the ensuite shower room, has a Mira Elite SE silent running electric shower unit. A Stira stairs leads up into the attic which is very extensive and is floored for yet more storage capacity. \n\nSaran Wood is a popular development off the Killarney Road and consists of family homes, duplexes and apartments. The location is very convenient and within easy walking distance to local shops including Pettits Supervalu and Bray Retail Park. There are several highly regarded primary and secondary schools in the vicinity and great public transport link options with frequent bus services stopping nearby along with the DART within 3.5km. Commuters have very quick access to the N11/M11/M50 corridor. For leisure enthusiasts there is Shoreline Leisure and pool next door, Kilruddery House and gardens, a host of local sports clubs and Bray's famous seafront and mile long promenade, all within easy reach.\n\nManagement fee: 1,800 p.a. approx\n\nEarly viewing of this exceptional property is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWelcoming hallway with Smart Storage understairs cabinetry and wide blank engineered timber flooring.\n\nStore Room - \nStorage and access to boiler (Ideal, installed 2025)\n\nKitchen / Breakfast - 2.68m x 6.48m\nAttractive range of fitted wall and floor units and range of quality appliances. Access to balcony. Tiled flooring\n\nLiving Room - 4.85m x 4.68m\nExpansive, bright room spanning width of property. Gas fire place with polished granite surround. Access to rear balcony.\n\nGuest WC - 1.41m x 1.53m\nUpgraded and modern with wash hand basin with timber shelving surround and tiled splash back and WC. Tiled flooring.\n\nLanding - \nCarpet flooring and access to attic via Stira stairs.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.85m x 3.80m\nDouble bedroom to rear with built in wardrobes. Carpeted flooring.\n\nEnsuite - 2.7m x 1.17m\nUpgraded and enlarged modern bathroom with shower cubicle (85cm x 120cm) and Mira Elite SE shower with double shower heads, wash hand basin and WC. Heated towel rail and extractor fan. Tiled flooring and fully tiled walls.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.73m x 4.7m\nDouble bedroom to front with built in wardrobes. Carpeted flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.22m x 3.5m\nBedroom to front with carpeted flooring.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.7m x 1.62m\nUpgraded modern bathroom with bath, shower screen, Mira Elite SE electric shower with double shower heads, wash hand basin and WC. Heated towel rail and illuminated mirror. Tiled flooring and partially tiled walls.\n\nHot Press - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>FEATURES</li><li>Absolutely stunning 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom, end of terrace duplex</li><li>Extending to 108 sq.m. and presented in true 'turn-key' condition</li><li>Substantially upgraded in 2023 to include refurbished and modernised bathrooms, quality flooring (wide plank engineered floorboards, luxury carpets and tiling), attic flooring and insulation, smart technology enabled lighting and superior finishes and décor throughout</li><li>Gas fired central heating with new Ideal boiler installed 2025</li><li>Prime setting within Saran Wood being end of terrace with verdant outlooks to both front and rear and beside pedestrian access gate to extensive amenity green</li><li>Two large balconies providing views of the Sugaroaf and manicured communal grounds</li><li>PhoneWatch security alarm</li><li>Excellent storage capacity including Smart Storage understairs units, built-in wardrobes and extensive attic space </li><li>Excellent location within easy walking distance to shops, primary and secondary schools and a variety of public transport links</li><li>All curtains, blinds and appliances are included in the sale</li><li>Management cost 1,800 p.a. approx.</ul>"
      },
